{"abstract":"The field of Deep Learning (DL) has undergone explosive growth during the last decade, with a substantial impact on Natural Language Processing (NLP) as well. Yet, compared to more established disciplines, a lack of common experimental standards remains an open challenge to the field at large. Starting from fundamental scientific principles, we distill ongoing discussions on experimental standards in NLP into a single, widely-applicable methodology. Following these best practices is crucial to strengthen experimental evidence, improve reproducibility and support scientific progress. These standards are further collected in a public repository to help them transparently adapt to future needs.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Ulmer, Dennis Thomas","Bassignana, Elisa","Müller-Eberstein, Max","Varab, Daniel","Zhang, Mike","van der Goot, Rob","Hardmeier, Christian","Plank, Barbara"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383838"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Deep learning","Experimental Standards","Natural Language Processing","Reproducibility","Scientific Methodology"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"experimental standards for deep learning in natural language processing research","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2204.06251","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383838","ids":["itu-b05d6e08-61c7-49ec-ad5d-e9ce8f0f531e"],"keyword":["Deep Learning","Experimental Standards","Natural Language Processing","Reproducibility","Scientific Methodology"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-8A925BE1E8372D218EFE41B5A6