{"abstract":"A lot of Machine Learning (ML) and Deep Learning (DL) research is of an empirical nature. Nevertheless, statistical significance testing (SST) is still not widely used. This endangers true progress, as seeming improvements over a baseline might be statistical flukes, leading follow-up research astray while wasting human and computational resources. Here, we provide an easy-to-use package containing different significance tests and utility functions specifically tailored towards research needs and usability.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Ulmer, Dennis Thomas","Hardmeier, Christian","Frellsen, Jes"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382283"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Computational Resources","Deep learning","Empirical Research","Machine learning","Statistical Significance Testing"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"deep significance easy and meaningful statistical significance testing in the age of neural networks","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/87038550/2204.06815.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382283","ids":["itu-448a8623-ec53-4e7a-bb63-74fd4d673b03"],"keyword":["Computational Resources","Deep Learning","Empirical Research","Machine Learning","Statistical Significance Testing"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-50089EF7987B566D5D09C90151A3C5E0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/87038550/2204.06815.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science, NLPnorth"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Dennis Thomas","key":"ulmerpau","last":"Ulmer","locid":"6596de1d-ea29-4252-a22e-f98cf28090c6","name":"Ulmer, Dennis Thomas","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"hardmeierpau","last":"Hardmeier","locid":"9504265d-0046-4e58-b529-256a656c012d","name":"Hardmeier, Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-6103-7275","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jes","key":"frellsenpau","last":"Frellsen","name":"Frellsen, Jes","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-448a8623-ec53-4e7a-bb63-74fd4d673b03"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"deep-significance - Easy and Meaningful Statistical Significance Testing in the Age of Neural Networks","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382283","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"We investigate the problem of determining the predictive confidence (or, conversely, uncertainty) of a neural classifier through the lens of low-resource languages. By training models on sub-sampled datasets in three different languages, we assess the quality of estimates from a wide array of approaches and their dependence on the amount of available data. We find that while approaches based on pre-trained models and ensembles achieve the best results overall, the quality of uncertainty estimates can surprisingly suffer with more data. We also perform a qualitative analysis of uncertainties on sequences, discovering that a model's total uncertainty seems to be influenced to a large degree by its data uncertainty, not model uncertainty. All model implementations are open-sourced in a software package.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Ulmer, Dennis","Frellsen, Jes","Hardmeier, Christian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-365352"],"event":{"end":"2022-12-11","place":"Abu Dhabi, ae","start":"2022-12-07","title":"2022 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2023-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Ulmer, Dennis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"exploring predictive uncertainty and calibration in nlp a study on the impact of method amp data scarcity","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85149889081","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-365352","identifier":[{"id":"85149889081","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-cb90165d-2ffb-4fff-9fdd-fb9408105796"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-271324B9EC056E44DFD291D92D0D9C2E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Cognitive Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Dennis","key":"ulmerpau","last":"Ulmer","name":"Ulmer, Dennis","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jes","key":"frellsenpau","last":"Frellsen","locid":"6333536d-7de1-46f9-ad12-8c397d149c1a","name":"Frellsen, Jes","orcid":"0000-0001-9224-1271","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"hardmeierpau","last":"Hardmeier","name":"Hardmeier, Christian","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"2707-2735","publisher":"Association for Computational Linguistics","status":"p","title":"Findings of the Association for Computational Linguistics: EMNLP 2022"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-cb90165d-2ffb-4fff-9fdd-fb9408105796"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Exploring Predictive Uncertainty and Calibration in NLP : A Study on the Impact of Method &amp; Data Scarcity","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-365352","year":"2022","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"We investigate the problem of determining the predictive confidence (or, conversely, uncertainty) of a neural classifier through the lens of low-resource languages. By training models on sub-sampled datasets in three different languages, we assess the quality of estimates from a wide array of approaches and their dependence on the amount of available data. We find that while approaches based on pre-trained models and ensembles achieve the best results overall, the quality of uncertainty estimates can surprisingly suffer with more data. We also perform a qualitative analysis of uncertainties on sequences, discovering that a model's total uncertainty seems to be influenced to a large degree by its data uncertainty, not model uncertainty. All model implementations are open-sourced in a software package.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Ulmer, Dennis Thomas","Frellsen, Jes","Hardmeier, Christian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384254"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Data uncertainty","Ensembles","Low resource languages","Model uncertainty","Neural classifier","Open source software","Pre trained models","Predictive confidence","Sequence analysis","Uncertainty Estimation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"exploring predictive uncertainty and calibration in nlp a study on the impact of method amp data scarcity","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.18653/v1/2022.findings-emnlp.198","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384254","identifier":[{"id":"85149889081","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-cc5a86d5-a1f6-45be-bd29-0c4319271ed7"],"keyword":["Data uncertainty","Ensembles","Low-resource languages